  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1740350035_3765841_4ea0aac1e45ea1c14dd65fe7120161af.PNG",
  "description": "<h3 style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f525/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🔥\" alt=\"🔥\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🔥\">&nbsp;H&amp;D Luxury Aromas &ndash; What Makes Us Unique?</strong></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/2728/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"✨\" alt=\"✨\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"✨\">&nbsp;<strong>Handcrafted with Quality</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Every candle and wax melt is carefully handmade with high-quality ingredients to ensure a&nbsp;clean, even burn&nbsp;and long-lasting fragrance.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f48e/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"💎\" alt=\"💎\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"💎\">&nbsp;<strong>Luxury Meets Affordability</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; We bring&nbsp;high-end, boutique-quality&nbsp;aromas at prices that make luxury accessible to everyone.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f33f/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🌿\" alt=\"🌿\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🌿\">&nbsp;<strong>Premium, Non-Toxic Ingredients</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Our products are made with&nbsp;clean-burning wax and phthalate-free fragrance oils, ensuring a&nbsp;safe&nbsp;and enjoyable experience in any home.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f31f/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🌟\" alt=\"🌟\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🌟\">&nbsp;<strong>Strong &amp; Long-Lasting Fragrance</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Our carefully curated scent blends provide a&nbsp;powerful scent throw, filling your space with rich, luxurious aromas.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f525/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🔥\" alt=\"🔥\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🔥\">&nbsp;<strong>Unique &amp; Diverse Scent Collection</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Whether you love fresh, fruity, cozy, or bold scents, we have&nbsp;a fragrance for every preference and mood.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f5a4/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🖤\" alt=\"🖤\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🖤\">&nbsp;<strong>Elegant &amp; Aesthetic Design</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Our candles and wax melts are designed to&nbsp;complement any home d&eacute;cor, making them perfect for both self-care and gifting.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f4b0/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"💰\" alt=\"💰\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"💰\">&nbsp;<strong>Loyalty Rewards &amp; Exclusive Offers</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Earn rewards for every purchase and enjoy&nbsp;special discounts&nbsp;through our&nbsp;First-Time Buyer Program &amp; Loyalty Program.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f680/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🚀\" alt=\"🚀\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🚀\">&nbsp;<strong>Fast &amp; Reliable Shipping</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; We ensure&nbsp;quick processing and delivery, so you can enjoy your favorite scents&nbsp;without the wait.</span><br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; white-space: normal; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">At H&amp;D Luxury Aromas, we believe fragrance is more than just a scent&mdash;it&rsquo;s an experience. Our handcrafted candles and wax melts are made with premium, all-natural ingredients to fill your space with warmth, relaxation, and a touch of luxury. From soothing florals to rich, bold aromas, our carefully curated collections are designed to elevate every moment.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Indulge in the art of fragrance with H&amp;D Luxury Aromas.&nbsp;<img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/2728/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"✨\" alt=\"✨\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"✨\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f56f_fe0f/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🕯️\" alt=\"🕯️\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🕯️\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f56f_fe0f/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🕯️\" alt=\"🕯️\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🕯️\">&nbsp;<strong>Luxury Candles</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; Available in<strong>&nbsp;</strong>4oz and 14oz sizes, our candles are made with high-quality wax and infused with exquisite fragrance blends. Whether you prefer soft florals, cozy vanillas, or bold masculine scents, we have something for every mood.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/16.0/1f56f_fe0f/32.png\" draggable=\"false\" aria-label=\"🕯️\" alt=\"🕯️\" class=\"an1\" data-emoji=\"🕯️\"><strong>&nbsp;Wax Melts&nbsp;</strong>&ndash; Enjoy a flameless fragrance experience with our 6-cavity wax melt packs or indulge in our large wax melt shapes for an eye-catching touch of aroma. Perfect for use with warmers, these melts provide a strong, long-lasting scent throw.</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Terms</strong>:</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You receive 15% commision from every purchase made using your link or code. The more you promote, the more you make!</span></p>",
